From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:49:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] BlueOS: Glimpse: Photo widgets

Any picture on the home screen: rounded, round with an accent ring, or a
sticker as is (PNG transparency kept). Four starting sizes, all resizable
and reconfigurable. The system photo picker opens right away; the picture
is copied, scaled down, and served to the launcher read-only by
BlueOSPhotoProvider under a random name.

